<title>UK: Rabobank sets 100 mln rand bond due 1999.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 100 mln rand bond due 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Toronto Dominion and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.375    MATURITY    07.MAY.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.025   PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    100.025   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P DENOMS AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
